# Built plugin bundle — a packaging artifact, never source. Produced from
# the committed dist/ + .claude-plugin/ and uploaded to the marketplace, so
# committing it means a binary that silently goes stale against the very
# commits it is built from (it embeds its own version and a commit stamp).
*.plugin
